{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6364ad71-90fd-810a-8658-06c805a02227",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T12:18:01-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:14:42-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:14:45-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Kevin. My name is Alan Lawton. I'm calling about trash and recycling pickup. I have a few details written down here, if you'll bear with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:14:56-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. I'll jot it down as you go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:15:00-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address is 353 Washington Street, in the Point. Our pickup was missed last week, and then it was missed again this week. So that's the second miss in a row."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:15:12-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 353 Washington Street, two misses in a row. Which day is your regular pickup supposed to be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:15:19-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Regular day is Monday. Yesterday was Monday, and the bins were out at the curb by seven in the morning. They were still full when I got home at the end of the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:15:32-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And the week before, was that a Monday too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:15:37-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Same thing. I left the barrels out until Tuesday morning and then brought them back in. Nothing had been touched."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:15:45-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Was it both trash and recycling, or just one of them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:15:50-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Trash both times. The recycling I put out is on the alternate week, so I can't say for the recycling. I have it written as trash only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:16:00-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Trash only, both Mondays. Anything blocking the street that you noticed? Parked cars, snow, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:16:08-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. The street was clear. There was some leftover wet from the rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago, but nothing in the way of the truck. The barrels were on the curb, lids closed, a few feet apart."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:16:23-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like you did everything right. I'll send this over to the route supervisor so they can get a truck out to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:16:32-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I'd also like the new schedule after the holiday week, if there is one. I'm not certain whether the days shifted, and I'd rather not put the barrels out on the wrong day a third time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:16:46-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check. [pause] Okay, so I'm showing that the holiday week pushed pickups back a day, and then things go back to the normal schedule after that. So for you, Monday should be Monday again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:17:00-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the regular Monday is correct for next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:17:04-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Normal Monday, next week and going forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:17:08-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll make a note of that. I mention the timing because I was off work on my lunch hour last Wednesday, when I walked over to a bookstore on Thames Street, and I thought I'd take a look at the posted schedule while I was out. I couldn't find one there, so I called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:17:28-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the easiest way to confirm. Do you want me to put a callback number on the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:17:36-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:17:38-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0168. I've got that down. Someone from the route should reach out, or just get the pickup done, probably in the next day or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:17:48-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll leave the barrels at the curb until it's collected. Thank you for your help, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:17:55-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mr. Lawton. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:17:59-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
